{"id":"neskol_ko","lemma":"несколько","pos":"adv","rank":171,"glosses":["somewhat, slightly, rather; some","multiple, a couple"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e1/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Пожалуйста, возьмите несколько.","en":"Please take some.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to take","l":"взять"},null]},{"text":"Я покажу тебе несколько.","en":"I will show you some.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to show","l":"показать"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Мы здесь уже несколько часов.","en":"We've already been here for a few hours.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"already"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"час"}]},{"text":"Я уже несколько месяцев тут работаю.","en":"I've already been working here for a few months.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"already"},null,null,{"g":"here"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"}]},{"text":"Я хочу ещё несколько.","en":"I want a few more.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"still / more"},null]}]}